<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka January '97 tea crop 21.3 mln kg.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka January '97 tea crop 21.3 mln kg.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka's tea crop in January this year was 21.3 million kg compared with 20.4 million kg in the same month in 1996, the Tea Board said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>The breakdown for January 1997 was 19.7 million kg of Orthodox and 1.6 million kg of CTC teas, it said.</p>
<p>Sri Lanka, the world's biggest tea exporter, had a record crop of 258.4 million kg for the whole of 1996.</p>
</text>
